{"page":108,"width":1657,"height":2173,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"廠장 데0터 모ß2t 성능","words":[{"text":"廠장","x":1243,"y":74,"width":60,"height":27},{"text":"데0터","x":1314,"y":74,"width":68,"height":26},{"text":"모ß2t","x":1394,"y":74,"width":65,"height":26},{"text":"성능","x":1469,"y":75,"width":42,"height":25}]},{"text":"제 5 절 본질식별자 vs. 인조식별자","words":[{"text":"제","x":206,"y":216,"width":48,"height":51},{"text":"5","x":267,"y":221,"width":28,"height":43},{"text":"절","x":310,"y":216,"width":43,"height":50},{"text":"본질식별자","x":379,"y":213,"width":216,"height":53},{"text":"vs.","x":613,"y":227,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"인조식별자","x":695,"y":212,"width":211,"height":52}]},{"text":"빠른 배포를 지畢卜는 개발 트렌드에서 개발 편의성을 위해 종종 발생하는 문제점 중 하나로 인조식별자의 남용에","words":[{"text":"빠른","x":237,"y":350,"width":53,"height":28},{"text":"배포를","x":301,"y":349,"width":78,"height":29},{"text":"지畢卜는","x":389,"y":348,"width":99,"height":30},{"text":"개발","x":497,"y":348,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"트렌드에서","x":553,"y":347,"width":114,"height":30},{"text":"개발","x":678,"y":347,"width":48,"height":30},{"text":"편의성을","x":734,"y":347,"width":97,"height":29},{"text":"위해","x":840,"y":347,"width":47,"height":29},{"text":"종종","x":898,"y":348,"width":50,"height":28},{"text":"발생하는","x":957,"y":346,"width":99,"height":30},{"text":"문제점","x":1065,"y":344,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"중","x":1150,"y":345,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"하나로","x":1187,"y":344,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"인조식별자의","x":1277,"y":343,"width":150,"height":31},{"text":"남용에","x":1440,"y":342,"width":73,"height":31}]},{"text":"대해 알아보자. 개발 편의성은 증대될 수 있겠지만 이에 따라 어떤 부작용을 야기喬는지를 확실히 이해하고자 한다.","words":[{"text":"대해","x":200,"y":397,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"알아보자.","x":265,"y":395,"width":111,"height":30},{"text":"개발","x":389,"y":395,"width":52,"height":29},{"text":"편의성은","x":450,"y":395,"width":97,"height":29},{"text":"증대될","x":556,"y":394,"width":69,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":636,"y":395,"width":24,"height":29},{"text":"있겠지만","x":670,"y":394,"width":96,"height":30},{"text":"이에","x":775,"y":393,"width":47,"height":30},{"text":"따라","x":834,"y":393,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"어떤","x":893,"y":393,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"부작용을","x":952,"y":393,"width":100,"height":30},{"text":"야기喬는지를","x":1061,"y":391,"width":157,"height":31},{"text":"확실히","x":1229,"y":391,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"이해하고자","x":1320,"y":390,"width":127,"height":32},{"text":"한다.","x":1456,"y":390,"width":58,"height":29}]},{"text":"그전에 인조식별자와 본질식별지에 대해 무엇인지 알아보자.","words":[{"text":"그전에","x":197,"y":442,"width":82,"height":30},{"text":"인조식별자와","x":296,"y":441,"width":158,"height":31},{"text":"본질식별지에","x":465,"y":441,"width":145,"height":30},{"text":"대해","x":625,"y":440,"width":46,"height":30},{"text":"무엇인지","x":684,"y":440,"width":96,"height":30},{"text":"알아보자.","x":795,"y":440,"width":106,"height":29}]},{"text":"엔터티는 반드시 데이터를 식별할 수 있는 속성이 존재해야 한다. 이를 우리는 식별자라고 배웠다. 식별자는","words":[{"text":"엔터티는","x":233,"y":489,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"반드시","x":354,"y":489,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"데이터를","x":445,"y":488,"width":97,"height":30},{"text":"식별할","x":555,"y":488,"width":71,"height":29},{"text":"수","x":637,"y":488,"width":24,"height":28},{"text":"있는","x":674,"y":487,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"속성이","x":733,"y":486,"width":72,"height":30},{"text":"존재해야","x":820,"y":486,"width":101,"height":29},{"text":"한다.","x":932,"y":486,"width":57,"height":29},{"text":"이를","x":1005,"y":486,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"우리는","x":1067,"y":485,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"식별자라고","x":1161,"y":485,"width":135,"height":29},{"text":"배웠다.","x":1310,"y":486,"width":85,"height":29},{"text":"식별자는","x":1411,"y":484,"width":104,"height":30}]},{"text":"대체 여부에 따라 본질식별자와 인조식별자로 분류할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"대체","x":197,"y":536,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"여부에","x":266,"y":536,"width":78,"height":29},{"text":"따라","x":360,"y":535,"width":52,"height":29},{"text":"본질식별자와","x":424,"y":534,"width":149,"height":31},{"text"